## The registry row text (both cells share everything but the dose and the band)

> GT-M1 RISK-ASYMMETRIC WORLD POOLING, `CELL_CVAR{25,50}`: one deck-paired cell,
> n=800 games (400 seat-balanced decks × 2 seatings), seeds `<BAND>..<BAND+399>`.
> CANDIDATE = the DEPLOYED production champion (fair PIMC k16×1376 = 22016 + the
> deployed root TIE ARBITER B=64/J=4/argmax/salt `tiearb2-deploy-v1`/eps 0.0/
> phase_gate all) with its **world-pooling rule replaced by lower-tail CVaR at
> α = {0.25, 0.50}** on the CANDIDATE SIDE ONLY (`--cand-pool-mode cvar
> --cand-pool-alpha`; a SEARCH-level knob that moves NO leaf hash). At k=16 that
> is the mean of the worst {4, 8} of 16 per-world root Q's. OPPONENT = THE SAME
> DEPLOYED AGENT pooling by the deployed visit-weighted mean, arbiter ARMED on
> BOTH seats. Leaf `a36d2e15a3b3d71d` BOTH SIDES, `rules_profile fixed_v1` +
> `CARCASSONNE_FIX_R9=1`, exact_k 2 marginalized, rust backend, LAPTOP W=22.
> LICENSED BY `measurement/cl083_mech_censuses_20260830` §1 (GT-M1 NOT KILLED:
> reach 0.340 [0.277, 0.404] at α=0.25 ≥ the 0.30 survive bar) — which
> deliberately did NOT price the change and DEMOTED the mechanism claim (control
> stratum 0.333 ≈ contest-exposed 0.340). ⛔ THIS IS A STRENGTH-LEVER SCREEN,
> NOT AN OWNER-EDGE DISCRIMINATOR. BARS EFFECT-SIZED per the owner ruling
> 2026-08-30: `P-POOLING-MOVES` needs LB95(M) > +1.0 pts/deck; `P-BOUNDED` needs
> UB95(M) < +1.0; `P-REGRESSION` needs UB95(M) < 0. Power disclosed: at
> se ≈ 0.68 a true null reads REGRESSION ~5% / BOUNDED ~38% / UNRESOLVED ~57% /
> ADOPT ~0.1%, and a true +1.0 adopts only 5% — **this round can bound and can
> detect a regression; it cannot confirm.** ⚠️ The two cells are CROSS-BAND
> (CL-068) and their difference is NOT a measured direction on α. ⚠️ Both doses
> confound risk aversion with equal-world-weighting (census DEVIATIONS D-1:
> 18.1pp of the 34.0pp reach is weighting); the α=1.00 separating arm is
> COSTED AND NOT FUNDED. `1759999990xx` is the THROWAWAY range and is NOT part
> of the claim. Pair: `measurement/cvar_pool_prep/PREREG.md`.
